<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cuts Jan-Aug trade gap to $2 bln--ministry.</title>
<headline>Hungary cuts Jan-Aug trade gap to $2 bln--ministry.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary reduced its trade deficit to $2,012.2 million in the first eight months of the year from $2,204.3 million in the same period of 1995, the Ministry of Industry and Trade said on Thursday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY'S TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>    ($million)    Jan-Aug 1996   Jan-July 1996   Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p>    Imports	   10,297.8	 9,015.4	   10.185.9</p>
<p>    Exports	    8,285.6	 7,270.6	    7,981.6</p>
<p>    Trade balance  - 2,012.2     - 1,744.8	  - 2,204.3</p>
<p>NOTE - MIT data are based on customs statistics.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 40 40</p>
</text>
